            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koyau imoŋin iarei, kotubutub kijuka oikorun kere luka Isirael kakan naka ikiyakia, ebe, “Ŋinituŋanan yenimam etupit Saul ka Samuel iswamakinio kwaŋin ikemonin.” Kodoik ituŋa akurian EJAKAIT, kopotu bala idiopetunanan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
